  "title": "Cocktail Meatballs",
  "description": "These cocktail meatballs are tasty, slow-cooked beef meatballs simmered in cranberry sauce, brown sugar, and chili sauce, perfect for holiday parties.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-12-30T15:01:13-05:00",
